'''Spider's Web''' is a [[debuff]] inflicted by {{sl|id=AspectOfTheSpider}} that causes affected targets to take 5% increased damage per stack. 

==Mechanics==
The maximum number of stacks is 3 (Level 20) or 4 (Level 30).

{{il|Fenumus' Spinnerets}} increases the maximum number of Spider's Web stacks by 1.

{{il|Fenumus' Weave}}, {{il|Fenumus' Toxins}} and {{il|Fenumus' Shroud}} further modify the debuff or those affected by it.

